oc=AdqE6YvJ_x8nMMe17CnqEWVRweFXfq4ewhNuaN2N7jxfymOZ8_m3n45JpEHRLy6mHiY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFPnkSajfBB_qfyyGqG5fsPHQOTKChI0oXxOEoDeWaiWg&oe=6A883ED5"}, {"file_name": "Scaff V1 SS6.png", "id": "1045602254609116", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499304952_1045602257942449_4798652243389336008_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6uhNuImslKEQ7kNvwFHH2yM&_nc_oc=AdpB4xVTWkoniD1XGsfAdR1Tmz_I0gTK0xsYgihmJjYsi6zW12M7i7MUrtxLyKBB1-k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFi8O9rbiKsiBfT52RjnzexJmkbdos02OR03ghEkTRoMg&oe=6A885014"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "AryaXR Scaffolding", "keywords": ["scaffolding", "construction", "safety"], "long_description": "Transform your industrial workforce training with the AryaXR Scaffolding VR Application - the definitive virtual reality simulation built for heavy industry, construction, and engineering teams. Designed to align with rigorous global safety standards, this application drops trainees directly onto a virtual job site to experience high-consequence scenarios with zero real-world physical risk.\n\nKey Training Modules & Features:\n-> Step-by-Step Assembly: Learn the precise sequence for erecting scaffolding structures, ensuring stable structural validation logic from the ground up.\n-> Component Identification: Master the correct identification and placement of standards, ledgers, transoms, couplers, and toe-boards.\n-> Dual Learning Modes: Build foundational knowledge in an interactive Practice Mode, then validate skills under pressure in Test Mode.\n->Performance Analytics: Track execution times and procedural accuracy instantly to measure trainee readiness.\n\nEquip your team with the muscle memory and confidence required to identify critical structural defects before they ever step onto a real job site.", "short_description": "Master tower scaffolding erection with zero 